    <string name="about_changelog">Changelog (main features):
&#8226; Real-time remote (SSE, no polling), video playback speed 0.5&#215;&#8211;2&#215;, share files via 24-hour temporary links + QR code
&#8226; Remote UI overhaul: mobile FAB for new download, bottom-sheet item actions, skeleton loading, pretty empty states, sticky filters, connection indicator + manual refresh, smooth animations, favicon &amp; theme-color
&#8226; Automatic file info before download starts (real name, size, type) + warning when larger than available storage
&#8226; Stable ETA &amp; speed (moving average, no more jumping)
&#8226; Smart queue: small files first (optional, in settings)
&#8226; Downloads interrupted by lost connection auto-resume when connectivity returns
&#8226; Remote HTTP from browser: PIN login, QR code, custom port, background server + auto-start
&#8226; YouTube-style remote gallery: 16:9 thumbnails, real video durations (cached), progressive loading
&#8226; YouTube-style video player: seekbar + buffered, auto-landscape fullscreen, double-tap &#177;10s, brightness/volume gestures, resume from last position, related videos
&#8226; Remote file manager: folder info, create folder, rename, move, bulk delete, ZIP
&#8226; Upload multiple files at once: chunked with automatic retry, whole-folder upload + drag &amp; drop, automatic duplicate rename (file (1).ext), close-page confirmation
&#8226; Duplicate names in the destination are auto-renamed on download completion (file (1).ext, file (2).ext, etc.) for every save location
&#8226; Remote page: active downloads pinned to the top, live total speed in the top bar, &#8220;&#8943;&#8221; action menu on phones, confirmation before delete/clear list
&#8226; Remote file manager: tappable breadcrumbs, &#8220;&#8943;&#8221; action menu (bottom sheet on phones), neat rename/move/delete dialogs, long-press for multi-select, tap media files to preview
&#8226; Stream &amp; download files via browser (HTTP Range)
&#8226; Parallel multi-segment downloads, resume, per-download speed limit &amp; priority
&#8226; Automatic retry with gradual backoff, auto-start on boot
&#8226; MD5/SHA1/SHA256 checksum verification
&#8226; Theme follows system (auto/light/dark)
&#8226; Remote page auto-lock after 10 minutes idle (PIN required again)
&#8226; Indonesian/English, homescreen widget, direct URL sharing</string>
